  "lyrics": [
    "[G]Tell it to [B7]every [C]kindred and nation, [G]Tell it [D]far [G]and [D]near;",
    "[D7]Earth's darkest night will [G]fade with the dawning, [D]Jesus will soon [G]appear.",
    "",
    "[G]Hail [Gaug]Him the [Am]King of [C]glory, [G]Once the [D]Lamb [G]for [D7]sinners [D]slain;",
    "[G]Tell, [G7]tell the [C]wondrous story, [G]\"Jesus [D]comes to [G]reign.\"",
    "",
    "Nations again in strife and commotion,",
    "Warnings by the way;",
    "Signs in the heavens, unerring omens,",
    "Herald the glorious day.",
    "",
    "Children of God look up with rejoicing;",
    "Shout and sing His praise;",
    "Bless'd are they who, waiting and watching,",
    "Look for the dawning rays."
